<section class="resource-hero systems-hero"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Residential and commercial roof systems</p><h1>Roofing materials explained by system—not just appearance.</h1><p>Majestic reviews slope, geometry, deck condition, drainage, ventilation, code and manufacturer requirements before the exact product is placed in a written proposal.</p></div></section><section class="systems-section section" id="systems"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Available project paths</p><h2>Six roofing categories Majestic can evaluate.</h2></div><p>Product availability and eligibility are confirmed in writing for the individual property. Current manufacturer names and exact Class 4 lines will be published after final company confirmation.</p></div><div class="systems-grid"><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-01.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Architectural asphalt shingles"/><div><span>01</span><h3>Architectural asphalt shingles</h3><p>Dimensional shingles for residential slopes, installed as a complete system with starter, underlayment, ridge, ventilation and flashing details.</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-03.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Class 4 impact-resistant options"/><div><span>02</span><h3>Class 4 impact-resistant options</h3><p>Products carrying a current Class 4 impact-resistance classification can be quoted by exact manufacturer and line. Classification does not mean impact-proof and does not promise an insurance discount or claim result.</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-05.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Designer and premium shingles"/><div><span>03</span><h3>Designer and premium shingles</h3><p>Heavier profiles and distinctive patterns may be available when the roof structure, slope, budget and current product specifications are appropriate.</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-07.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Metal roofing"/><div><span>04</span><h3>@Lang.T("Metal roofing")</h3><p>Standing-seam and other metal options are evaluated for substrate, transitions, penetrations, ventilation, thermal movement and manufacturer requirements.</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-09.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Low-slope and flat roofing"/><div><span>05</span><h3>Low-slope and flat roofing</h3><p>The selected membrane or coating depends on drainage, existing assembly, penetrations, insulation, deck condition and commercial or residential use.</p></div></article><article><img src="/img/projects/roof-project-11.jpeg" alt="Completed roof illustrating Commercial roof systems"/><div><span>06</span><h3>Commercial roof systems</h3><p>Inspection, leak investigation, maintenance, repairs and replacement scopes for qualifying retail, restaurant, office, warehouse, multifamily, church and development projects.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="scope-section section" id="selection"><div class="site-shell scope-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">How a system is selected</p><h2>The right roof starts with the right questions.</h2><p>The free inspection includes photographs, a report and estimated measurements. Majestic then explains repair, replacement, claim-related documentation or out-of-pocket options.</p></div><ul><li>Roof slope and geometry</li><li>Deck and moisture condition</li><li>Ventilation and attic conditions</li><li>Flashing, chimney and penetrations</li><li>Wind, hail and fire classifications</li><li>Written manufacturer and workmanship warranty</li></ul></div></section><section class="credentials-section section"><div class="site-shell"><div class="credential-grid"><a href="https://www.certainteed.com/profiles/majestic-roofing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><strong>SM</strong><span>CertainTeed ShingleMaster profile since 2021</span></a><article><strong>10</strong><span>year workmanship warranty on qualifying replacements</span></article><article><strong>EN/ES</strong><span>bilingual product explanation</span></article></div></div></section><section class="resource-cta section"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Start with facts</p><h2>Request a free roof inspection.</h2><a href="/#contact" class="button button-gold">Request inspection →</a></div></section>
